>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-99a73b5 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"99a73b5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n							<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n			<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n						</span>\n		</div>\n						</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-248b0a3 elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"248b0a3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n									<p>Protecting People and Their Property Is Our Specialty.</p>								</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dcd9035 elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"dcd9035\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n									<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n					<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-md\" href=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjExOTgiLCJ0b2dnbGUiOmZhbHNlfQ%3D%3D\">\n						<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n									<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">GET A QUOTE</span>\n					</span>\n					</a>\n				</div>\n								</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n		</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-e41b243\" data-id=\"e41b243\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n			<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap\">\n							</div>\n		</div>\n					</div>\n		</section>\n				<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-f8a31d1 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"f8a31d1\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n						<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n					<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-e3eb981\" data-id=\"e3eb981\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n			<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n						<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7f86ed2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7f86ed2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n					<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">UNARMED SECURITY GUARD SERVICES BY Security and Patrol</h2>				</div>\n				</div>\n				<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-7023354 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"7023354\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n						<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\">\n					<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-206b990\" data-id=\"206b990\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n			<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n						<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c0d2752 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"c0d2752\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n															<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1083\" height=\"1452\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ChatGPT-Image-Aug-8-2026-08_05_41-PM-1.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-4943\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ChatGPT-Image-Aug-8-2026-08_05_41-PM-1.png.webp 1083w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ChatGPT-Image-Aug-8-2026-08_05_41-PM-1-224x300.png.webp 224w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ChatGPT-Image-Aug-8-2026-08_05_41-PM-1-764x1024.png.webp 764w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ChatGPT-Image-Aug-8-2026-08_05_41-PM-1-768x1030.png.webp 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1083px) 100vw, 1083px\" />															</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n		</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-386a93b\" data-id=\"386a93b\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n			<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n						<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cc48568 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"cc48568\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n					<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">UNARMED SECURITY GUARD SERVICES IN  \n\n<span style=\"color:#EE8E09;font-weight:600\">CALIFORNIA </span> BY Security and Patrol</h3>				</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a35e06b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a35e06b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n									We provide private security services in California not only for diplomatic personnel, but also for high-ranking national officials and private citizens. Our security officers are highly trained to handle any circumstance that may arise while providing physical and mental protection to you and those around you. Our private security personnel are also equipped to constantly treat your clients with professionalism and courtesy while looking out for any burglaries or property damage. Security officers who are not armed are responsible for ensuring the safety and security of people, assets, and facilities. Unarmed security guard services in California by Security and Patrol are dependable, prepared, and skilled in handling changing circumstances.								</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n		</div>\n					</div>\n		</section>\n					</div>\n		</div>\n					</div>\n		</section>\n				<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-22a1615 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"22a1615\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n						<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n					<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-e012b87\" data-id=\"e012b87\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n			<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap\">\n							</div>\n		</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-8b193c7\" data-id=\"8b193c7\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n			<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n						<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7eb25d3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7eb25d3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n					<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Top 5 Benefits of Unarmed Security Guards in California </h2>				</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-45d0340 elementor-widget elementor-widget-accordion\" data-id=\"45d0340\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"accordion.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n							<div class=\"elementor-accordion\">\n							<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n					<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-7321\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-7321\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n													<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n															<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i></span>\n								<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-up\"></i></span>\n														</span>\n												<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">1.Enhanced Safety Measures</a>\n					</div>\n					<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-7321\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-7321\"><div class=\"elementskit-card active\"><div id=\"Collapse-b4025d16412fad03ede4\" class=\"collapse show\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-0-5fa01fb\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6412fad03ede4\"><div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\"><p>Unarmed security guards provide a non-violent approach to ensuring safety and security, making them an ideal choice for public events and low-risk environments. Their techniques allow them to diffuse potentially volatile situations without the use of force, creating a safer environment for everyone involved. </p></div></div></div></div>\n				</div>\n							<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n					<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-7322\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-7322\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n													<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n															<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i></span>\n								<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-up\"></i></span>\n														</span>\n												<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">2.Cost-Effective Security Solution </a>\n					</div>\n					<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-7322\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-7322\"><div class=\"elementskit-card active\"><div id=\"Collapse-10c385f6412fad03ede4\" class=\"collapse show\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-1-5fa01fb\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6412fad03ede4\"><div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\"><p>Hiring unarmed security guards is a cost-effective way to deter crime and protect your property, without the added expense of armed security personnel.</p></div></div></div></div>\n				</div>\n							<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n					<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-7323\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"3\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-7323\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n													<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n															<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i></span>\n								<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-up\"></i></span>\n														</span>\n												<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">3. Improved Customer Service</a>\n					</div>\n					<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-7323\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-7323\"><div class=\"elementskit-card active\"><div id=\"Collapse-c98d9cd6412fad03ede4\" class=\"collapse show\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-2-5fa01fb\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6412fad03ede4\"><div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\"><p>Unarmed security guards are trained to provide excellent customer service while maintaining a safe and secure environment, making them a valuable asset to businesses and events. They can also assist with directing foot and vehicle traffic, responding to emergencies, and providing information to the public.</p></div></div></div></div>\n				</div>\n							<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n					<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-7324\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"4\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-7324\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n													<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n															<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i></span>\n								<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-up\"></i></span>\n														</span>\n												<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">4. Flexibility and Adaptability</a>\n					</div>\n					<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-7324\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"4\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-7324\"><div class=\"elementskit-card active\"><div id=\"Collapse-c4215326412fad03ede4\" class=\"collapse show\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-3-5fa01fb\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6412fad03ede4\"><div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\"><p>Unarmed private security guards can adapt to a variety of situations and environments, from busy public spaces to quiet residential neighborhoods. Their roles may include monitoring and reporting suspicious activity, controlling access to certain areas, and providing a visible presence to deter crime. </p></div></div></div></div>\n				</div>\n							<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n					<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-7325\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"5\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-7325\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n													<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n															<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i></span>\n								<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-up\"></i></span>\n														</span>\n												<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">5. Legal Compliance </a>\n					</div>\n					<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-7325\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"5\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-7325\"><p>Unarmed security guards are trained to adhere to legal guidelines and regulations, ensuring that your security measures are in compliance with the law. This can give peace of mind to both clients and the public, knowing that the security personnel are operating within the boundaries of the law.</p></div>\n				</div>\n								</div>\n						</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n		</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-5f02dc2\" data-id=\"5f02dc2\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n			<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap\">\n							</div>\n		</div>\n					</div>\n		</section>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-77bb748 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"77bb748\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n					<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fa66f83 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"fa66f83\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n					<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">UNARMED SECURITY GUARD SERVICES IN  \n\n<span style=\"color:#EE8E09;font-weight:600\">PORTLAND </span> BY Security and Patrol</h2>				</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0404dcb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0404dcb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n									Unarmed private Security Services by Security and Patrol in Portland provides top-notch security services to businesses and individuals in the Portland area. With a highly-trained team of professionals and years of experience in the industry, Security and Patrol is dedicated to providing the best possible security solutions to meet the needs of its clients. Whether you need unarmed security services for your business, event, or personal protection, Security and Patrol has you covered.								</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n				<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-8430059 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"8430059\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n						<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n					<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-38bce7e\" data-id=\"38bce7e\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n			<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap\">\n							</div>\n		</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-479857f\" data-id=\"479857f\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n			<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated